{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Deadline Dash 是一款簡潔的每日規劃與倒數計時工具，特別適合學生、專業人士及自由工作者。不論是管理作業、工作期限或個人目標，它都能幫助你保持井井有條、準時完成，並減少壓力。目前限時免費，原價 US $2.99，千萬別錯過。</p>\n\n<h2>追蹤截止日期無壓力</h2>\n<p>Deadline Dash 提供倒數計時器，讓你清楚掌握剩餘時間；每日待辦清單讓規劃更快速；自訂提醒確保重要期限不會遺漏。你還能使用顏色和標籤個人化任務，並透過 Today Widget 一眼查看所有截止日期，且支援重複性任務與目標。介面簡單直觀，幫助你建立規律並保持動力。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-221-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-222-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-223-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-224-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-225-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-226-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Deadline Dash</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T18:58:08.431499+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}